# Facts about Seraphine Hale.

@fact seraphine.seer
tier: surface
text: A seer who speaks in half-sentences and is unsettlingly often right.

@fact seraphine.slips
tier: personal
unlock: seen(seraphine_lost_day) > 0
text: Sometimes she slips a day ahead and needs someone to tell her what today is.

@fact seraphine.oracle
tier: personal
hint: Become good friends with her.
unlock: rel(seraphine) >= 15
text: Her mother is the Oracle of Vell, who wants her home to tell kings what they want to hear.

@fact seraphine.self
tier: personal
unlock: chosen(seraphine_painting, right)
text: Seers can't see themselves, unless someone is standing next to them.

@fact seraphine.lake
tier: secret
unlock: flag(seraphine_lake_told)
text: The lake calls to her at night. She says it calls to you too.

@fact seraphine.too_loud
tier: secret
unlock: seen(seraphine_overwhelmed) > 0
text: When everyone's futures get too loud she hides in the dark. Yours, she says, is quiet.

@fact seraphine.paintings
tier: personal
hint: Stay at the castle over the summer break, and visit the Observatory at night.
unlock: seen(seraphine_dont_look) > 0 or seen(brk_starfall_observatory) > 0
text: What she sees ahead comes out in her paintings, sometimes months early. She hides the ones she didn't mean to paint under her bed.

@fact seraphine.petitioners
tier: personal
hint: Spend a break in the capital, and call at the Oracle's Rooms.
unlock: seen(oracle_window_seat) > 0
text: In the capital she sits in her mother's window and paints the people queuing on the stairs as they will be in a year. She never shows them.

@fact seraphine.other_ending
tier: secret
hint: Call at the Oracle's Rooms once you are close.
unlock: seen(oracle_other_painting) > 0
text: Her mother has seen her say yes to the family seat. Under the window seat in the capital, Seraphine keeps a painting of herself saying no.
